Here's the README from the wiretap server:

The Clinton/* directories contain press releases
from the Clinton administration.

Currently, these are organized as:

  gore/*      Remarks of Al Gore
  misc/*      Miscellaneous
  myers/*     Briefings by Dee Dee Myers
  orders/*    Executive Orders
  prez/*      Remarks of Bill Clinton
  steph/*     Briefings by George Stephanopolous

The hierarchy will change as sufficient material is collected
on a particular subject (example, "ethics").

We have lots of disk space, and this machine isn't going
anywhere, so you can expect this archive to be somewhat permanent.

The Internet Wiretap
gopher@wiretap.spies.com

